# The pictures of check-solid.md: Check Solid on a sound solid, and on
# a mesh with naked edges, which it draws.
load tlspr/golden/group/boolean_tangent_edge/normal.tlspr
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
cursor off
shot check-solid-1-sound gw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
load tlspr/golden/group/force_to_mesh/fillet.tlspr
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
mark 292 46 56 124
shot check-solid-2-naked gw
